2026-11-14T00:02:12.1413015Z ## 2. Validation failure found and fixed: the fixed-path family was growing
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1413356Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1413631Z Running the lane's own enforced probe on current bytes returned **50** bundles
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1414136Z (5000 decisions / 58 verified) where the published measurement is **49**
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1414667Z bundles (4900 / 55). The cause was structural, not a pipeline regression:
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1414934Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1415194Z - every cycle writes `results/product/offline_slice/<run>_verify/*.bundle.json`;
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1415775Z - those verification outputs carry `provenance.counter_evidence_span.content_filter`,
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1416361Z   which is exactly the predicate the probe used to identify the fixed-path
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1416774Z   family;
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1417203Z - so each verification cycle silently added a 100-decision bundle to a frozen
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1417835Z   baseline. The predecessor's own committed verify directory had already moved
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1418448Z   49 → 50; this cycle's verify output would have moved it to 51.
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1418741Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1418910Z Fix in `product/content_family_probe.py`:
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1419147Z 
