2026-11-14T00:02:12.1419891Z   (149 bundles, D2=44 D3=31 D4=7 historical defects preserved);
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1420443Z - `bundle_paths()` — the frozen flagship family, excluding directories matching
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1421244Z   `*_verify/`; verification output is still measured in `all_committed` and in
2026-11-14T00:02:12.1421802Z   its own slice summary, but cannot move a published family baseline.
