2026-11-14T00:02:16.0664904Z failed workflow.  Two independent questions must be answered before the
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0665661Z snapshot can be handed to an auditor:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0665974Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0666355Z 1. **Why did the run stop before a gate?** - answered from the committed
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0667182Z    public run/jobs snapshot by :mod:`product.audit_step_diagnosis` (no token,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0668278Z    no job logs, no invented mechanism).
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0668962Z 2. **Does the persisted snapshot carry a durable delta at all?** - answered
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0669808Z    from git refs alone.  A snapshot equal to its predecessor's commit is
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0670689Z    ``ZERO_DURABLE_DELTA``: the workflow's ``if: always()`` persist step
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0672039Z    published the unchanged tree after the failed producer step, so the ref
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0672795Z    exists but proves no work.
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0673077Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0673461Z The module also records, read-only, whether this run has either half of
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0674375Z factory-wide requirement 4 (an independent audit gate and an accept commit),
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0675361Z and whether the producer wrote anything into the auditor namespace.  It never
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0676201Z writes ``results/audit/**``, never mints a gate, and never labels a run
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0676853Z accepted or rejected.
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0677147Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0677338Z Usage
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0678069Z -----
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0678575Z     python3 product/resume_snapshot_diagnosis.py \\
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0679409Z         --run-id 40193974025 --predecessor-run-id 40188639817 \\
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0680380Z         --raw results/product/orchestration/CYCLE_40193974025_team_step_raw.json \\
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0681540Z         --out results/product/orchestration/CYCLE_40193974025_resume_diagnosis.json
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0682228Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0682613Z When no public run/jobs snapshot was captured for the resumed run (for example
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0683510Z an operational resume dispatched straight from a failed run whose logs are not
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0684437Z reachable from the producer environment), omit ``--raw``: the instrument then
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0685293Z records ``RAW_SNAPSHOT_UNAVAILABLE`` / ``mechanism_unobserved`` instead of
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0686191Z inventing a cause, while still proving the durable-delta fact from git refs.
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0687138Z ``--predecessor-ref`` (default ``origin/lab/product``) compares the snapshot
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0688001Z against the accepted head the failed run was dispatched from, which is the
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0689048Z right delta baseline for a resume run: comparing against the previous *team*
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0689860Z ref would count the accepted audit commit as if the failed run had produced it.
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0690366Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0690675Z Refs must already be available locally (the workflow fetches ``main``,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0702575Z ``lab/<lane>`` and the team ref).  The instrument never fetches, so an
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0703456Z offline reproduction is honest about a missing ref instead of silently
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0704163Z reaching the network.
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0704617Z """
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0705079Z from __future__ import annotations
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0705458Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0705630Z import argparse
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0706073Z import json
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0706428Z import re
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0706873Z import subprocess
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0707292Z import sys
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0707785Z from datetime import datetime, timezone
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0708315Z from pathlib import Path
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0708748Z from typing import Any
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0709003Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0709276Z REPO_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0709868Z if str(REPO_ROOT) not in sys.path:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0710396Z     sys.path.insert(0, str(REPO_ROOT))
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0710760Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0711306Z from product import audit_step_diagnosis as asd  # noqa: E402
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0712252Z from product import query_env  # noqa: E402
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0712920Z from product import resume_chain_diagnosis as rcd  # noqa: E402
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0713386Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0713697Z SCHEMA = "product-resume-snapshot-diagnosis/1"
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0714296Z ACCEPTED_REF = "origin/lab/product"
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0714868Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0714876Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0715177Z def _git(*args: str) -> subprocess.CompletedProcess:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0715850Z     return subprocess.run(["git", *args], cwd=str(REPO_ROOT),
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0716523Z                           capture_output=True, text=True)
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0716907Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0716914Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0717094Z def _rev(ref: str) -> str | None:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0717687Z     p = _git("rev-parse", "--verify", "--quiet", ref)
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0718268Z     if p.returncode != 0:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0718701Z         return None
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0719146Z     return p.stdout.strip() or None
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0719454Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0719461Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0719815Z def _delta(snapshot_ref: str, predecessor_ref: str) -> dict[str, Any]:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0720444Z     head = _rev(snapshot_ref)
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0721132Z     pred = _rev(predecessor_ref)
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0721618Z     out: dict[str, Any] = {
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0722109Z         "snapshot_ref": snapshot_ref,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0722670Z         "snapshot_head": head,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0723145Z         "predecessor_ref": predecessor_ref,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0723728Z         "predecessor_head": pred,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0724197Z     }
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0724592Z     if head is None or pred is None:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0725128Z         out["classification"] = "REF_ABSENT"
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0725632Z         out["meaning"] = (
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0726237Z             "at least one ref is not available in this checkout, so the delta "
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0726988Z             "cannot be proven locally; this is UNREPRODUCED, never ZERO_DELTA "
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0727656Z             "and never a durable delta"
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0728037Z         )
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0728315Z         return out
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0728637Z     if head == pred:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0728987Z         out["classification"] = "ZERO_DURABLE_DELTA"
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0729370Z         out["changed_files"] = 0
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0729770Z         out["changed_paths_sample"] = []
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0730118Z         out["meaning"] = (
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0730755Z             "the team ref points at the predecessor's exact commit: the "
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0731700Z             "producer added and changed nothing, and the always-run persist "
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0732232Z             "step published that unchanged tree. This is an orchestration "
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0732786Z             "outcome, NOT a product defect and NOT a verdict; refs alone cannot "
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0733327Z             "distinguish rc-67 zero-delta from a producer death."
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0733727Z         )
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0734577Z         return out
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0734986Z     paths = _git("diff", "--name-only", pred, head).stdout.splitlines()
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0735454Z     out["classification"] = "COMMITTED_DELTA"
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0735870Z     out["changed_files"] = len(paths)
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0736604Z     out["changed_paths_sample"] = paths[:20]
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0736978Z     out["meaning"] = (
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0737393Z         "the team ref carries a committed delta over its predecessor; the "
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0737905Z         "snapshot can be resumed and audited on its own bytes"
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0738290Z     )
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0738545Z     return out
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0738758Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0738764Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0738924Z def _accept_commit(run_id: str) -> dict[str, Any]:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0739336Z     if _rev(ACCEPTED_REF) is None:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0739797Z         return {"accepted_ref_present": False, "accept_commit": None}
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0740300Z     log = _git("log", ACCEPTED_REF, "--format=%H%x09%s").stdout.splitlines()
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0740739Z     needle = f"accept product cycle {run_id}"
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0741347Z     for line in log:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0741702Z         sha, _, subject = line.partition("\t")
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0742192Z         if subject.strip() == needle:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0742615Z             return {"accepted_ref_present": True, "accept_commit": sha,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0743192Z                     "accept_subject": subject.strip()}
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0743791Z     return {"accepted_ref_present": True, "accept_commit": None}
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0744077Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0744082Z 
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0744276Z def _audit_half(run_id: str) -> dict[str, Any]:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0744703Z     audit_ref = f"origin/cycle/core/product/{run_id}/audit"
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0745115Z     audit_head = _rev(audit_ref)
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0745505Z     gate_rel = f"results/audit/product/CYCLE_{run_id}_GATE.json"
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0745922Z     if audit_head is None:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0746256Z         return {
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0746535Z             "audit_ref": audit_ref,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0746942Z             "audit_ref_present": False,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0747342Z             "gate_file_present": (REPO_ROOT / gate_rel).exists(),
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0747757Z             "gate_verdict": None,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0748097Z         }
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0748387Z     raw = _git("show", f"{audit_ref}:{gate_rel}")
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0748790Z     gate = None
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0749085Z     if raw.returncode == 0:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0749401Z         try:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0749738Z             gate = json.loads(raw.stdout)
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0750100Z         except json.JSONDecodeError:
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0750511Z             gate = {"unparseable": True}
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0750972Z     return {
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0751290Z         "audit_ref": audit_ref,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0751664Z         "audit_ref_present": True,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0752008Z         "audit_head": audit_head,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0752369Z         "gate_file_present": gate is not None,
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0752745Z         "gate_verdict": (gate or {}).get("gate"),
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0753157Z         "safe_to_integrate": (gate or {}).get("safe_to_integrate"),
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0753662Z         "required_fixes": (gate or {}).get("required_fixes"),
2026-11-14T00:02:16.0754075Z     }
