2026-11-14T00:03:14.4793045Z     "D1-D4 content predicates. It re-derives no frozen scorer population or "
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4793512Z     "emission predicate, scores no frozen bar, evaluates no serve verdict and "
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4793981Z     "makes no legal-usefulness claim. Historical bundles that predate the fix "
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4794385Z     "are preserved evidence, not current-head defects."
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4794664Z )
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4794757Z 
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4794936Z #: The four decisions the accepted FAST-MVP falsifier (evaluation run
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4795381Z #: 40105794124, accept bcb4520a) measured as verified-but-content-defective.
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4795837Z #: Ordered work (1) requires per-row BEFORE/AFTER for exactly these rows plus
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4796187Z #: the one sound row.
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4796409Z ACCEPTED_DEFECTIVE_ROWS = {
