2026-11-14T00:03:14.4798799Z CONFIRMED_SOUND_DECISION_ID = "bstger_SK.2023.49"
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4799007Z 
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4799204Z #: Packet-of-record v3 bytes.  This module NEVER writes to this directory; the
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4799676Z #: arm re-run happens on deep copies and the committed sha256 is published so
2026-11-14T00:03:14.4800046Z #: a reader can see the bytes did not move.
