2026-11-14T00:04:27.6858618Z """Cycle 43373102286: resume 43363900852, repair family population, audit-ready.
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6858916Z 
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6859112Z The resumed snapshot (run ``43363900852``, team ref ``756fa4e3``) had already
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6859580Z diagnosed and verified the lane deliverable, but its independent-audit job died
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6860053Z at the same workflow work quantum as its predecessor and its own validation
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6860425Z surface had a latent inconsistency:
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6860599Z 
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6860775Z * every cycle writes a ``*_verify/`` bundle carrying the same fixed-path
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6861606Z   provenance as a flagship bundle, so the frozen fixed-path family silently
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6862063Z   grew on each verification cycle (49 -> 50 -> 51).  That contradicts the
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6862497Z   published 49-bundle / 4900-decision baseline the audit dossier pins;
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6862891Z * the new historical cycle test equality-pinned the live
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6863297Z   ``current_cycle_run_id`` pointer, so it would fail on this successor cycle.
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6863743Z 
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6863927Z This cycle fixes both in the product's own instruments (not by re-scoring a
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6864361Z frozen bar) and re-verifies the end-to-end slice on current bytes.
2026-11-14T00:04:27.6864679Z """
